title AVG-02 Wallet Responds with Selective-Disclosure VP · PRD 2.13 · US-15
participant Owner
participant Calling_Agent
participant Zetrix_Registry
participant Wallet_BE_HSM
participant MBI
participant AVG
participant Service
==CHECK AND CONSENT==
Service-->Calling_Agent:5. proof request (challenge, service did:zid, template IDs, claims, expiry, submit URL)
Calling_Agent->Zetrix_Registry:look up service card by did:zid
Zetrix_Registry-->Calling_Agent:service card (service name, AVG URL)
Calling_Agent->Calling_Agent:submit URL = AVG URL on card; not expired; matching Agent Cert held, not expired, not revoked
Calling_Agent->Owner:[service name from card] wants your name. Share it? (non-default claims only)
Owner-->Calling_Agent:yes
==CREATE AND SUBMIT VP==
Calling_Agent->Wallet_BE_HSM:sign x401 challenge with agent key
Wallet_BE_HSM-->Calling_Agent:signature
Calling_Agent->MBI:6. create VP (requested claims only; ownerIdType with ownerId)
MBI-->Calling_Agent:VP
Calling_Agent->AVG:7. submit VP to AVG URL on card (proofRequestId)
AVG-->Calling_Agent:8a. signed result
Calling_Agent->Service:8b. forward signed result unchanged (x401 header)
alt OWNER DECLINES
Owner-->Calling_Agent:no
Calling_Agent->Service:DISCLOSURE_DECLINED (no VP created)
end
alt SERVICE NOT IN REGISTRY OR SUBMIT URL DOES NOT MATCH CARD
Calling_Agent-->Service:PROOF_REQUEST_NOT_TRUSTED (no consent asked, no VP)
end
alt CREDENTIAL NOT HELD, EXPIRED OR REVOKED
Calling_Agent-->Owner:explain how to get the needed Agent Cert, no VP
end
